  "title": {
    "rendered": "Executive Assistant to the CEO"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>Myrias is looking for an <strong>Executive Assistant</strong> to work directly with our founder and CEO, Yaqi Grover. This is a high-trust, high-variety role: you&#8217;ll get close exposure to how an organization gets built, how funding decisions get made, and how a small, ambitious team moves quickly on a neglected problem — while also handling the practical, day-to-day work that makes that possible.</p>\n<p>We&#8217;re looking for someone early in their career who is driven, passionate about farmed animal welfare, and committed to supporting us as we ramp up over the next year and beyond.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>This is a high-trust, high-variety role: you’ll get close exposure to how an organization gets built, how funding decisions get made, and how a small, ambitious team moves quickly on a neglected problem – while also handling the practical, day-to-day work that makes that possible.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
